        "runtime_resources_profile": {
          "threading_supported": false,
          "default_threads": 1,
          "max_threads": 1,
          "upstream_mapping": "The reviewed BoolODE YAML exposes only a do_parallel boolean; the pinned implementation calls multiprocessing.Pool() without a process-count argument and hard-codes KMeans n_jobs=8. The wrapper therefore rejects runtime_resources.threads != 1, writes do_parallel=false, and patches the imported public BoolODE KMeans constructor to n_jobs=1 before calling BoolODE.ConfigParser.parse(...).execute_jobs()."
        },
